61380874563b333a546e0bbaab56&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","login":"lawnjelly","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly"},"body":"Barring my preference for 32 bit, it looks great, but I can see I'm outvoted on that and it's not a hill to die on.\r\n\r\nAs long as I get bragging rights when you later realise 32 bit was a better choice. :+1: :wink: ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100293#pullrequestreview-2669488264","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100293","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-09T18:10:38Z"}]